{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50132","headline":"佛教梵文唵字唐玄宗书并读（原刻石在河南登封，还有御制《老子赞》。） 二 · 唐明皇","name":"佛教梵文唵字唐玄宗书并读（原刻石在河南登封，还有御制《老子赞》。） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹤立蛇形势未休，五尺文字鬼神愁。\n儒门弟子无人识，穿耳胡僧笑点头。\n（〖1〗现在根据最古的敦煌本补入，而把所知所见的石本刻本作爲附录，以便参考。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐明皇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}